{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》迎來高潮，2023年港姐五強郭珮文與前男友Ice於水族館過夜環節進行深夜對話 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》迎來高潮，2023年港姐五強郭珮文與前男友Ice於水族館過夜環節進行深夜對話。面對男方早前與其他女參加者過從甚密引發信任危機，男方突然給出深情承諾。女方聽畢後的真實反應及最終決定，直接令大批觀眾感到極度震驚。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>昔日因「Long D」分手 男方早前因缺「邊界感」惹禍</strong></b></h2>\n<p>回顧兩人的感情背景，Juliana與Ice昔日曾有一段情，但最終因難以維繫「Long D」（異地戀）而遺憾分手。今次兩人在《女神配對計劃2》再度碰頭，本以為有機會破鏡重圓，惟早前Ice在節目遊戲環節中，與另一女嘉賓陳星妤出現親密肢體接觸，令Juliana當場呷醋，事件亦引發網民熱議，狠批Ice對其他異性欠缺「邊界感」。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>水族館過夜真心話 Ice承諾改變即融化舊愛</strong></b></h2>\n<p>在最新播出的水族館浪漫過夜環節中，兩人趁著靜謐氣氛展開一場深夜真心話。面對Juliana坦承自己在感情中一直缺乏安全感，Ice隨即趁機為早前與陳星妤的互動再次解畫。起初仍帶點委屈及保持距離的Juliana，語帶無奈地表示：「我沒資格說你們甚麼……」見舊愛依然介懷，Ice即發揮甜言蜜語攻勢，向Juliana許下深情承諾，聲稱未來會為她作出改變，從此不想再讓她承受這種難受的感覺。這番說話瞬間擊中Juliana的軟肋，令她防線全面崩潰。她在事後接受訪問時更難掩內心喜悅，一臉甜笑地表示：「我其實係好開心嘅。之前因為呢啲問題我哋都磨合咗好耐，但係佢而家好似真係有想改變嘅心，我係好開心嘅。」</p>\n<h2><b><strong>網民質疑男方「得個吹字」 痛心Ju姿態太低</strong></b></h2>\n<p>雖然節目畫面充滿粉紅泡泡，兩人看似迎來復合曙光，但一眾網民卻並不受落，更對Juliana極速原諒對方的舉動大感痛心。不少網民在討論區留言質疑Ice的承諾只是「空頭支票」，狠批：「佢都係得個吹字」，認為男方欠缺邊界感是本性難移。同時，大批粉絲對Juliana太容易心軟「沉船」感到恨鐵不成鋼，紛紛留言勸諫：「唔好人地講兩句你又沉番」、「Ju值得更好」、「唔明點解要咁低姿態去就條仔，佢完全畀Ice食住」。更有網民一針見血指出，兩人當初分手的死穴「Long D」問題至今仍未解決，單靠幾句承諾根本無補於事。雖然有網民無奈笑言「真係冇得救，快啲一齊返」、「你哋鎖死吧」，但更多人依然希望Juliana能保持清醒，切勿在愛情中將姿態放得太低。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030192587546_15835785576afa7aae50bc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J7.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030192587546_15835785576afa7aae50bc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948003032629017_5451480866afa7aafe8b84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J3.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948003032629017_5451480866afa7aafe8b84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030566734479_6493498446afa7ab204bcd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J1_0.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030566734479_6493498446afa7ab204bcd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030740939111_14492723166afa7ab3dfbc0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J9.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030740939111_14492723166afa7ab3dfbc0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480031068183870_9497234276afa7ab71ec7c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J5.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480031068183870_9497234276afa7ab71ec7c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%80%e6%84%9b%e7%9c%9f%e4%ba%ba%e9%a8%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戀愛真人騷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e7%8f%ae%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭珮文</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543596\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:52:38.071666+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1396,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:38:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:27:09.891584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:46:10.684733+00:00","content_hash":"f3d304c65df032ee490fc456dad51a241ea224d82d3239bcfbc871301cb4ae2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}